 --frozen`：30/30 阶段 PASS；unit 2,629、contract 552、真实 PG/Redis integration 270、E2E 77。源码/基线不变，清理退出 0。\n- `node scripts/sdar-smpp-v13/verify-gowm.mjs`：固定 owner schema 安装、受限角色正式业务链和原生边界共 8 步 PASS；与完整门禁的 2,807 个仓库源码/基线文件一致。\n- AC-001–050：48 个本地 PASS；现场 AC-045/046 NOT_RUN。Provider/Model 为本地协议夹具；PG/Redis、Server/A2A 和竞争/SIGKILL 进程为真实隔离运行。\n- 官方 A2A HTTP JSON/MUST TCK：74 passed、161 skipped、30 deselected；未执行项保持未验证。原失败结果与日志均保留。\n\n完整结果和样例：\n\n- `reports/sdar-smpp-v13-upgrade/20261010-local/FINAL_CLOSEOUT.md`\n- `reports/sdar-smpp-v13-upgrade/20261010-local/CASE_RESULTS.json` / `M1_VALIDATION.json`–`M4_VALIDATION.json`\n- `reports/sdar-smpp-v13-upgrade/20261010-local/EVIDENCE_SAMPLES.json` / `FAILED_ATTEMPTS.json`\n- `reports/sdar-smpp-v13-upgrade/20261010-local/publication-20261011/staged-source-check.json`：提交中的运行源码/基线与冻结门禁逐字节一致。\n\n迁移：0184 仅恢复原生 `task_input_request.source` 的 `remote_task` 允许值。保留旧 baseline SQL；down 遇保留输入会拒绝，未决命令阻止旧版接管写入口。GOWM 消费者无 DDL 或私有 SMPP 写权限。详见 `MIGRATION_AND_ROLLBACK.md`。\n\n现场、部署和全项目发布验收未执行；缺失的逐点源时钟/完整事件历史以及原项目 GOWM 上游缺口保持明确记录。PR34 已先独立合并。本 PR 按用户授权提交、推送及普通 merge，不绕过分支规则。\n","created_at":"2026-10-11T01:55:19Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T01:55:32Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"3ee0e52c308d39b555e48d99384d9f9217be09b0","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/pulls/35/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/pulls/35/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/issues/35/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/statuses/b2544c16c4087f0c056a1e4e2f23698a1648bf7d","head":{"label":"zhouwen-giser:codex/sdar-smpp-